Subject: [PATCH] workaround: mfd: mt6375: preserve firmware protection
 settings

Restrict writes to the retained TCPC, interrupt and measurement whitelist,
with the bounded opt-in charger exceptions. Preserve firmware protection
configuration and exclude the software-reset register.

